  28:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @{
  29:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  */
  30:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c **** 
  31:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c **** /**
  32:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @defgroup PIDRegulator PID Regulator
  33:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @brief PID regulator component of the Stellar Motor Control
  34:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  *
  35:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * The PID regulator component implements the following control function:
  36:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  *
  37:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f[
  38:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * u(t) = K_{p} e(t) + K_{i} \int_0^t e(\tau) \,d\tau + K_{d} \frac{de(t)}{dt}
  39:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f]
  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  *
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * with the proportional, integral and derivative gains expressed as rational numbers, with a gain 
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  *
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f[
  44:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * K_{p} = \frac{K_{pg}}{K_{pd}}
  45:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f]
  46:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f[
  47:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * K_{i} = \frac{K_{ig}}{K_{id}}
  48:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f]
  49:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f[
  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * K_{d} = \frac{K_{dg}}{K_{dd}}
  51:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f]
  52:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  *
  53:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  *  Each of the gain and divisor parameters, @f$K_{{p}g}@f$, @f$K_{{i}g}@f$, @f$K_{{d}g}@f$, @f$K_{
  54:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @f$K_{id}@f$, @f$K_{dd}@f$, can be set independently. via the PID_SetKP(), PID_SetKPDivisorPOW2(
  55:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * PID_SetKIDivisorPOW2(), PID_SetKD()
  56:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  *
  57:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  * @{
  58:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c ****  */
  59:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c **** 
  60:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/pid_regulator.c **** /**
